{"seq":6,"slug":"persuasion-influence","title":"说服与影响力","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"说服与影响力\">说服与影响力</h1><p>说服是人类社会中最古老也最核心的沟通能力之一。从亚里士多德的修辞学到现代社会心理学，从政治演说到商业营销，说服力的研究和实践贯穿了人类文明的发展历程。在当今组织环境中，无论是推动变革、争取资源、协调跨部门合作还是赢得客户信任，说服与影响力都是实现目标的关键杠杆。与简单的命令或权力施压不同，有效的说服建立在理解人类心理、尊重对方自主性和创造共同价值的基础之上。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 从四个维度系统构建说服与影响力的知识体系：首先是说服科学基础，涵盖 Cialdini 的影响力六原则、Petty 与 Cacioppo 的精细加工可能性模型（ELM）以及认知偏误在说服中的应用，为理解说服的心理机制提供理论框架；其次是修辞与表达技巧，从亚里士多德的修辞三要素到叙事说服和公众演讲，探讨如何将说服理论转化为具体的语言和表达策略；第三部分聚焦组织影响力，分析向上影响、横向协作和变革管理中的说服实践，帮助读者在复杂的组织政治中有效发挥影响力；最后是数字时代的说服，涵盖行为设计与助推、内容营销中的品牌说服以及说服伦理与操纵边界的深度讨论。</p>\n<p>无论你是希望在会议中更有说服力的中层管理者，还是需要推动组织变革的高管，或是关注用户行为设计的产品经理，本 Hub 都将提供从理论到实践、从个人到组织、从线下到数字的全方位说服力提升路径。核心原则贯穿始终：真正持久的影响力，来自于理解他人需求并创造双赢价值，而非操纵或欺骗。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"persuasion-science","title":"说服科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/persuasion-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cialdini-principles","title":"Cialdini 影响力六原则 Cialdini's Six Principles of Influence","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/persuasion-science/cialdini-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elaboration-likelihood","title":"精细加工可能性模型 Elaboration Likelihood Model","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/persuasion-science/elaboration-likelihood"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-biases-persuasion","title":"认知偏误与说服 Cognitive Biases and Persuasion","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/persuasion-science/cognitive-biases-persuasion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rhetorical-skills","title":"修辞与表达技巧","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/rhetorical-skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aristotle-rhetoric","title":"亚里士多德修辞三要素 Aristotle's Three Modes of Persuasion","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/rhetorical-skills/aristotle-rhetoric"},{"seq":2,"slug":"storytelling-persuasion","title":"叙事说服 Narrative Persuasion","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/rhetorical-skills/storytelling-persuasion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-speaking","title":"公众演讲技巧 Public Speaking Skills","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/rhetorical-skills/public-speaking"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-influence","title":"组织影响力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/organizational-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"upward-influence","title":"向上影响力 Upward Influence","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/organizational-influence/upward-influence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lateral-influence","title":"横向影响与同级协作 Lateral Influence and Peer Collaboration","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/organizational-influence/lateral-influence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"change-management","title":"变革管理中的说服 Persuasion in Change Management","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/organizational-influence/change-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-persuasion","title":"数字时代的说服","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/digital-persuasion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"behavioral-design","title":"行为设计与助推 Behavioral Design and Nudging","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/digital-persuasion/behavioral-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-marketing","title":"内容营销与品牌说服 Content Marketing and Brand Persuasion","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/digital-persuasion/content-marketing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-manipulation","title":"说服伦理与操纵边界 Ethics of Persuasion and Boundaries of Manipulation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/persuasion-influence/digital-persuasion/ethics-manipulation"}]}]}